          "name": "Membrane",
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "description": "The graph boundary that contains its internal presentation and locates exposed controls. Encoding: an authored frame and, optionally, a chain of membrane control nodes. Boundary meaning is distinct from the nodes used to draw it.",
