      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Meaning\n\nThe graph boundary that contains its internal presentation and locates exposed controls. Encoding: an authored frame and, optionally, a chain of membrane control nodes. Boundary meaning is distinct from the nodes used to draw it."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-membrane",
          "nodeId": "membrane-meaning"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "membrane-invariants",
      "label": "Invariants",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": 120,
        "y": -440
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          }
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          },
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Invariants\n\nA boundary encloses a graph instance; it does not transfer ownership of nodes outside its outline. A custom control chain must be complete and unbranched. A selected representation uses the existing workspace frame. Surface, resolution and focus changes do not implicitly resize it, reflow neighbors or change camera zoom. Manual resizing is explicit. Internal nodes, edges, handles and pointer targets are clipped; exposed boundary controls remain accessible. Workspace title bars belong to View representations (including glyph-shaped artwork), not a terminal Glyph."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-membrane",
          "nodeId": "membrane-invariants"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "membrane-contract",
      "label": "Contract",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": -1000,
        "y": 300
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          }
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          },
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Contract\n\nDeclaration boundary-begin/boundary-end relationships delimit the control chain; membrane nodes carry position and segmentToNext. graphWorkspace also reads authored membrane bounds and clip state. The declaration/landing-surface relationship supplies the default interface frame."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-membrane",
          "nodeId": "membrane-contract"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "membrane-ports",
      "label": "Ports and Relationships",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": 120,
        "y": 300
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
