          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Membrane\n\nThe graph boundary that contains its internal presentation and locates exposed controls. Encoding: an authored frame and, optionally, a chain of membrane control nodes. Boundary meaning is distinct from the nodes used to draw it.\n\nOpen this graph to read its eight specification sections and follow its example Portals."
